---
interface Props {
  title: string;
}
const { title } = Astro.props;
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{title} — ARTBEAT</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="topnav">
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>About</a>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/members`}>Members</a>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/videos`}>Videos</a>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/shorts`}>Shorts</a>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/live`}>Live</a>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/schedule`}>Schedule</a>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/history`}>History</a>
  </nav>
  <slot />
  <footer class="disclaimer">
    <p>
      본 팬 페이지는 수익을 창출하지 않으며, 순수한 팬심으로 제작된 비공식 사이트입니다.
      버그를 발견하셨거나 문의사항이 있으시면 <a href="mailto:kangjw0914@gmail.com">kangjw0914@gmail.com</a>으로 한글 또는 영어로 남겨주세요.
    </p>
    <p>
      This fan page does not generate any revenue and is an unofficial site made purely out of fan passion.
      If you encounter a bug or have any inquiries, please contact <a href="mailto:kangjw0914@gmail.com">kangjw0914@gmail.com</a> in English or Korean.
    </p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --bg: #0e0e10;
    --ink: #f4f2ee;
    --muted: #8b8a8f;
    --accent: #ffffff;
    --line: #232326;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .topnav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px 24px 0;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .topnav a {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .topnav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 9vw, 72px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .disclaimer {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 32px 24px 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .disclaimer p {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .disclaimer a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: underline; }
  .disclaimer a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
